second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which administrative body is twinned with Menzel Bourguiba?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 186, \"text\": \"As Amira wandered through the winding streets of Menzel Bourguiba, the scent of freshly baked bread wafted from the local patisserie, enticing her to stop and sample the day's offerings.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 187, \"end\": 283, \"text\": \"The Tunisian town, with its rich history and vibrant culture, was a treasure trove of surprises.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 284, \"end\": 423, \"text\": \"Amira, a curious and intrepid traveler, had stumbled upon a small, unassuming plaque on the town hall's facade, which caught her attention.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 424, \"end\": 465, \"text\": \"It read: \\\"Twin Town: Berane, Montenegro.\\\"\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 466, \"end\": 600, \"text\": \"Intrigued, Amira wondered what connection this small Tunisian town could possibly have with a municipality in northeastern Montenegro.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 601, \"end\": 683, \"text\": \"She decided to investigate further, seeking out the local mayor, Monsieur Ben Ali.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 684, \"end\": 813, \"text\": \"Over a steaming cup of mint tea, he regaled her with stories of the twinning ceremony, which had taken place several years prior.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 814, \"end\": 910, \"text\": \"\\\"It was a grand affair, I assure you,\\\" Monsieur Ben Ali said, his eyes twinkling with nostalgia.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 911, \"end\": 1030, \"text\": \"\\\"The mayor of Berane, a kind and jovial man named Dragan, came to our town with a delegation of officials and citizens.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1031, \"end\": 1084, \"text\": \"We shared our traditions, our music, and our cuisine.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1085, \"end\": 1148, \"text\": \"It was a true celebration of friendship and cultural exchange.\\\"\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1149, \"end\": 1338, \"text\": \"As Amira listened, she imagined the festivities: the sound of the darbuka drums, the aroma of grilled meats and spices, and the laughter of people from two different worlds coming together.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1339, \"end\": 1448, \"text\": \"She envisioned the mayors of both towns, standing side by side, exchanging gifts and promises of cooperation.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1449, \"end\": 1536, \"text\": \"Monsieur Ben Ali continued, \\\"Since then, we've had several exchanges between our towns.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1537, \"end\": 1711, \"text\": \"Students from Berane have come to study Arabic and Tunisian history here, while our own students have traveled to Montenegro to learn about the rich heritage of the Balkans.\\\"\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1712, \"end\": 1741, \"text\": \"Amira's curiosity was piqued.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1742, \"end\": 1853, \"text\": \"She decided to reach out to Dragan, the mayor of Berane, to learn more about the twinning from his perspective.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1854, \"end\": 2041, \"text\": \"As she sat in the town's internet café, typing away on her laptop, she felt a sense of connection to this small town in Montenegro, a place she had never seen but now felt drawn to visit.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2042, \"end\": 2127, \"text\": \"The sun began to set over Menzel Bourguiba, casting a warm orange glow over the town.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2128, \"end\": 2299, \"text\": \"Amira smiled, knowing that she had stumbled upon something special – a testament to the power of friendship and cultural exchange, which transcended borders and distances.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 79, \"text\": \"**Twin Cities: Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba Celebrate Decades of Friendship**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 81, \"end\": 318, \"text\": \"In a testament to the power of international cooperation and cultural exchange, the German city of Stuttgart and the Tunisian town of Menzel Bourguiba have been twinned for decades, fostering a strong bond between the two municipalities.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 319, \"end\": 511, \"text\": \"According to official records, the twinning agreement between Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba was signed in 1964, marking the beginning of a fruitful partnership that has spanned over 50 years.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 512, \"end\": 677, \"text\": \"This unique relationship has enabled the exchange of ideas, expertise, and cultural practices between the two cities, promoting mutual understanding and cooperation.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 678, \"end\": 771, \"text\": \"\\\"We are proud to have Menzel Bourguiba as our twin city,\\\" said Stuttgart's Mayor, Fritz Kuhn.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 772, \"end\": 886, \"text\": \"\\\"Our partnership has led to numerous joint projects and initiatives, which have greatly benefited both our cities.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 887, \"end\": 962, \"text\": \"We look forward to continuing this strong friendship in the years to come.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 963, \"end\": 1057, \"text\": \"One of the key areas of cooperation between the two cities has been in the field of education.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1058, \"end\": 1286, \"text\": \"Stuttgart's University of Applied Sciences has established a partnership with Menzel Bourguiba's University of Tunis, enabling students and faculty members to participate in exchange programs and collaborative research projects.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1287, \"end\": 1386, \"text\": \"\\\"The twinning agreement has opened up new opportunities for our students and researchers,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1387, \"end\": 1434, \"text\": \"Amel Ben Abda, Dean of the University of Tunis.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1435, \"end\": 1584, \"text\": \"\\\"We have been able to tap into Stuttgart's expertise in fields such as engineering and technology, which has greatly enhanced our academic programs.\\\"\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1585, \"end\": 1753, \"text\": \"In addition to education, the two cities have also collaborated on projects related to urban planning, environmental sustainability, and cultural heritage preservation.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1754, \"end\": 1963, \"text\": \"Stuttgart's expertise in green technology and sustainable urban development has been particularly valuable to Menzel Bourguiba, which is seeking to modernize its infrastructure and reduce its carbon footprint.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1964, \"end\": 2133, \"text\": \"\\\"The partnership with Stuttgart has been instrumental in helping us develop our city's infrastructure and services,\\\" said Menzel Bourguiba's Mayor, Mohamed Ali Bouazizi.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2134, \"end\": 2264, \"text\": \"\\\"We have learned a great deal from their experience and expertise, and we look forward to continuing this fruitful collaboration.\\\"\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2265, \"end\": 2432, \"text\": \"Data from the German-Tunisian Chamber of Industry and Commerce shows that the twinning agreement has also led to increased trade and investment between the two cities.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2433, \"end\": 2614, \"text\": \"In 2020, bilateral trade between Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba reached €15 million, with Stuttgart-based companies investing heavily in Tunisia's manufacturing and tourism sectors.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Berane, Montenegro\", \"scope\": \"Twin Town of Menzel Bourguiba\", \"claim\": \"The plaque on the town hall's facade in Menzel Bourguiba reads: \\\"Twin Town: Berane, Montenegro.\\\"\", \"answer\": \"Berane, Montenegro\", \"quote\": \"It read: \\\"Twin Town: Berane, Montenegro.\\\"\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Berane, Montenegro\", \"Stuttgart\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Berane, Montenegro\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Stuttgart\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
      }
